  skipto gelkis when turnedin 94873
  skipto magram when onquest 1385,93226,1367,94872
  skipto magram when turnedin 1385
  skipto magram when turnedin 93226
  skipto magram when turnedin 1367
  skipto magram when turnedin 94872
  tip No clan's quests in your log: the guide goes on with the Gelkis. For the Magram, take their choice quest and Buying Friendship and the guide goes to the Magram half.
  goto 66.7,10.9 "Captain Pentigast" only Alliance
  goto 56.3,59.7 "Gurda Wildmane" only Horde

step Gelkis: the choice quest
  label gelkis
  tip The Gelkis half starts with the clan's choice quest from the giver you just handed the totems to: Uthek's quests in Gelkis Village follow from it, and Buying Friendship alone does not open them.
  accept 1382 only Alliance           -- Strange Alliance, Captain Pentigast
  accept 1368 only Horde              -- Gelkis Alliance, Gurda Wildmane

step Gelkis Village: Uthek and Molkar
  tip Gelkis Village sits in the hills of south-west Desolace; Uthek the Wise stands at its heart. Molkar, the Gelkis quartermaster, is at the south end of the village. Buying Friendship alone takes you from Neutral to Friendly.
  turnin 1382 only Alliance           -- Uthek the Wise: 250
  accept 1384 only Alliance           -- Raid on the Kolkar
  turnin 1368 only Horde              -- Uthek the Wise: 250
  accept 1370 only Horde              -- Stealing Supplies
  turnin 93227 @35.6,92.0 only Alliance -- Molkar: 3,000
  turnin 94873 @35.6,92.0 only Horde  -- Molkar: 3,000

step Gelkis: the Kolkar camps
  only Alliance
  tip The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) hold the camps south of Nijel's Point, along the eastern road. About one in four drops a Crude Charm.
  collect 6079 x10 quest 1384.1 @69.5,44.0 -- Crude Charm: Kolkar centaurs
  turnin 1384                         -- Uthek the Wise: 500
  accept 1370

step Gelkis: Magram Village
  tip The Sacks of Meat lie about Magram Village, in the south-east. Every Magram you kill on the way pays the Gelkis 20.
  collect 6069 x6 quest 1370.1 @69.8,77.9 -- Crudely Dried Meat: Sacks of Meat
  kill 4640 optional                  -- Magram Wrangler: 20 Gelkis
  kill 4641 optional                  -- Magram Windchaser: 20 Gelkis

step Gelkis: Ongeku
  tip Back to Uthek, then east to the Swamp of Sorrows: Ongeku (level 37) waits by a black cauldron in Fallow Sanctuary, north-east of Stonard.
  turnin 1370                         -- Uthek the Wise: 500
  accept 1373
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  collect 6190 quest 1373.1           -- Draenethyst Shard: Ongeku
  zone Desolace
  turnin 1373                         -- Uthek the Wise: 1,000

step Gelkis: totems and kills to Honored
  tip Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 4,000 into it, so 2,000 to go. Molkar's Economic Warfare takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again: three turn-ins, 15 totems. The Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western Desolace drop them; the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Magram kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village also has three craft orders for 1,000 each: Halea wants 3 Greater Mystic Essences, Molkar a White Bandit Mask (tailoring) and Talra a Barbaric Harness (leatherworking). Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%.
  collect 254432 x5 optional @29.5,58.0 -- Carved Centaur Totem: Maraudine centaurs
  accept 92812 @35.6,92.0 optional    -- Economic Warfare
  turnin 92812 @35.6,92.0 optional    -- Molkar: 750
  rep 92 Honored

step Gelkis: Uthek sends you to the valley
  tip At Honored and level 35, Uthek sends you east to Nerlokh, a Gelkis scout at the western mouth of the Valley of Bones, where the south of Desolace runs into Shen'dralas. The valley steps follow Forever's quest data: nobody who records their play has done these quests yet, so a spot or the order may be off. Every valley quest asks you to stay Honored with the Gelkis, and each costs the Magram five times what it pays. Honored to Revered is 12,000; the valley pays 10,625 of it, Economic Warfare the rest.
  level 35
  accept 93034                        -- Uthek the Wise: Valley of Bones

step Gelkis: Nerlokh
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: Nerlokh waits at the valley's western mouth. He wants six Undead Ravagers put to rest and the ritual garb of an Outcast Necromancer: the outcasts are Gelkis exiles who took up the Magram's necromancy.
  turnin 93034                        -- Nerlokh: 125
  accept 93035
  accept 93037

step Gelkis: the valley's mouth
  tip From the quest data: the Undead Ravagers and the Outcast Necromancers fill the valley from Nerlokh north-east to Orgrul's post at its northern mouth; players have met them all along it. Orgrul's Magram are hostile to a friend of the Gelkis. Corpsefeeders, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack anyone.
  kill 11561 x6 quest 93035.1
  collect 255875 quest 93037.1        -- Necromantic Garb: Outcast Necromancers

step Gelkis: Facing the Truth
  tip From the quest data: Nerlokh gives you a Gelkis Necromantic Garb to show Uthek, with an Accursed Skull you find yourself: a freshly cursed skull, hoarded in the jaws of one of the valley's giant skeletons. The game's data has no spot for it.
  turnin 93035                        -- Nerlokh: 500
  turnin 93037                        -- Nerlokh: 500
  accept 93041
  collect 255945 quest 93041.1        -- Accursed Skull: in a giant skeleton's jaws

step Gelkis: Uthek and Mulara
  zone Desolace
  tip From the quest data: back west to Uthek in Gelkis Village. She needs Tears of Theradras: Mulara, the Voice of Theradras, keeps them in the cave in the south of the village, past Molkar. Ask her for them on Uthek's behalf and bring three back. Molkar takes Economic Warfare on the way.
  turnin 93041                        -- Uthek the Wise: 500
  accept 93044
  talk 253713                         -- Mulara, in the cave
  complete 93044                      -- three Tears of Theradras
  accept 92812 @35.6,92.0 optional    -- Economic Warfare
  turnin 92812 @35.6,92.0 optional    -- Molkar: 750

step Gelkis: Test Your Theory
  tip From the quest data: Uthek gives you her staff and a Draenethyst Crystal. Put them together into Uthek's Draenethyst Staff, take it to the ritual site by the pond just east of the village and dispel the curse on the Accursed Skull. Then east again to Nerlokh.
  turnin 93044                        -- Uthek the Wise: 500
  accept 93045
  complete 93045                      -- dispel the Accursed Skull by the pond

step Gelkis: back to Nerlokh
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: Nerlokh pays 500 and your pick of three weapons for level 35: Centaur Spear (polearm), Wanderer's Broadsword (two-handed sword) or Desert Crawler's Claw (dagger). Then he has two jobs deeper in the valley.
  turnin 93045 choose 271794 271795 271799 -- Nerlokh: 500
  accept 93058
  accept 93062

step Gelkis: the heart of the valley
  tip From the quest data: east of Nerlokh, in the heart of the valley, the Magram hold Gelkis Captives: free five. Among them lie Haggard Bones, failed summons stuck in the ground: lay eight to rest with Uthek's Draenethyst Staff, which the quest gives you. Corpsefeeders and Magram Necrokhans, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack a friend of the Gelkis: let them pass before you pull.
  kill 253446 x8 quest 93062.1 "Lay Haggard Bones to rest"
  complete 93058 @45.12,32.26 live    -- free five Gelkis Captives

step Gelkis: Checking Things Out
  tip From the quest data: Nerlokh's next order takes you deeper into Shen'dralas to scout two places: the Magram Front, a Magram camp south-east of the valley, and the Outcast Hideaway, the exiles' camp west of the Shen'dralar town, further south.
  turnin 93058                        -- Nerlokh: 500
  turnin 93062                        -- Nerlokh: 500
  accept 93122

step Gelkis: the Magram Front and the Outcast Hideaway
  tip From the quest data: walk into the Magram camp at the Magram Front, then south-west into the Outcast Hideaway, where Outcast Necrokhans, elite and level 45, stand guard. In a tent there Rokren, a Gelkis the outcasts hold, asks you to get him out: escort him clear of the hideaway, then tell Nerlokh.
  goto 59.27,53.93 "Magram Front" live
  accept 93125                        -- Rokren
  complete 93125                      -- escort Rokren out of the hideaway
  complete 93122

step Gelkis: Nerlokh's last order
  tip From the quest data: with the Magram's warriors busy at the Front, Nerlokh sees a chance at their khan.
  turnin 93122                        -- Nerlokh: 500
  turnin 93125                        -- Nerlokh: 500
  accept 93128

step Gelkis: Khan Jehn
  zone Desolace
  tip From the quest data: Khan Jehn (level 37) leads the Magram from the west side of Magram Village, north-east of Nerlokh. The village is hostile to a friend of the Gelkis, and two Magram Necrokhans, elite and level 45, stand a little west of the khan. Uthek pays 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: Abandoned Ferocity (two-handed axe: Strength, Stamina, Agility), Bludgeon of Betrayed Virtues (one-handed mace: Strength, Stamina, Agility) or Thrice-Damned Effigy (off-hand: Spirit, Intellect, Stamina). The quest costs the Magram 30,000.
  kill 5601 quest 93128.1 @66.0,80.4  -- Khan Jehn
  turnin 93128 choose 271801 271802 271805 -- Uthek the Wise: 6,000

step Gelkis: totems to Exalted
  tip From Revered on only Economic Warfare is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems. Nothing is sold for standing; the recipes below need only totems.
  collect 254432 x5 optional @29.5,58.0
  accept 92812 @35.6,92.0 optional
  turnin 92812 @35.6,92.0 optional
  rep 92 Revered
  rep 92 Exalted optional

