step Magram Village: Warug and Gorhak
  label magram
  tip Magram Village fills the valley of south-east Desolace; Warug stands on its north side, Gorhak, the Magram quartermaster, near the lake. Buying Friendship alone takes you from Neutral to Friendly.
  accept 1385 only Alliance           -- Brutal Politics, Captain Pentigast
  accept 93226 npc 5396 only Alliance -- Buying Friendship: Magram, Captain Pentigast
  accept 1367 only Horde              -- Magram Alliance, Gurda Wildmane
  accept 94872 only Horde             -- Buying Friendship: Magram, Gurda Wildmane
  turnin 1385 only Alliance           -- Warug: 250
  accept 1386 only Alliance           -- Assault on the Kolkar
  turnin 1367 only Horde              -- Warug: 250
  accept 1369 only Horde              -- Broken Tears
  turnin 93226 npc 253139 only Alliance -- Gorhak: 3,000
  turnin 94872 npc 253139 only Horde  -- Gorhak: 3,000

step Magram: the Kolkar camps
  only Alliance
  tip The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) hold the camps south of Nijel's Point.
  kill 4632 x12 quest 1386.1 @68.6,48.0 -- Kolkar Centaur
  kill 4633 x12 quest 1386.2 @68.5,40.0 -- Kolkar Scout
