step Magram: Broken Tears
  tip The Tears of Theradras are crystals in the cave behind Gelkis Village, in the south-west. Every Gelkis you kill on the way pays the Magram 20.
  collect 6083 x3 quest 1369.1 @39.7,93.7 -- Broken Tears: the Tear of Theradras crystals
  kill 4648 optional                  -- Gelkis Stamper: 20 Magram
  kill 4649 optional                  -- Gelkis Windchaser: 20 Magram
  turnin 1369                         -- Warug: 500
  accept 1371 optional                -- Gizmo for Warug

step Magram: Gizmo for Warug
  tip Warug wants an Advanced Target Dummy: engineers make it (4 Heavy Leather, a Gyrochronatom, a Bronze Framework and an Iron Strut); others buy one. It pays 1,000 and a choice of two engineering schematics, the Centaur Banner Deployment Device or the Hoof-Shaped Foot Pedal.
  collect 4392 quest 1371.1 optional @75.0,68.2 -- Advanced Target Dummy: made by engineers, or bought
  turnin 1371 optional                -- Warug: 1,000

step Magram: totems and kills to Honored
  tip Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 3,000 into it (4,000 with Gizmo for Warug), so 2,000 to 3,000 to go. Gorhak's Economic Warfare takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again; the Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western Desolace drop them, and the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Gelkis kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village has two craft orders for 1,000 each: Mirda's 3 Greater Shadow Protection Potions and Grolkar's 2 Massive Iron Axes (blacksmithing). Warug's A Conqueror's Crown (1,000) is no craft order: he wants a Conqueror's Helm from a crypt in the Badlands, and Forever's quest pages put it in his chain before the Valley of Bones, so bring it before you reach Honored. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%.
  accept 92743 optional               -- A Conqueror's Crown: Warug
  turnin 92743 optional               -- Warug: 1,000
  collect 254432 x5 optional @29.5,58.0 -- Carved Centaur Totem: Maraudine centaurs
  accept 92811 npc 253139 optional    -- Economic Warfare
  turnin 92811 npc 253139 optional    -- Gorhak: 750
  rep 93 Honored

step Magram: Warug sends you to the valley
  tip At Honored and level 35, after A Conqueror's Crown, Warug sends you to Orgrul at the south end of Magram Village, the northern mouth of the Valley of Bones. The valley steps follow Forever's quest data: nobody who records their play has done these quests yet, so a spot or the order may be off. Every valley quest asks you to stay Honored with the Magram, and each costs the Gelkis five times what it pays. Honored to Revered is 12,000; the valley pays 11,125 of it, Economic Warfare the rest.
  level 35
  accept 92841                        -- Warug: Valley of Bones

step Magram: Orgrul
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: Orgrul wants bones from the valley's Undead Ravagers (the quest log counts them in hundreds) and six Outcast Necromancers dead: Gelkis exiles meddling with the Magram's new magic.
  turnin 92841                        -- Orgrul: 125
  accept 92844
  accept 92846

step Magram: the valley's mouth
  tip From the quest data: the Undead Ravagers and the Outcast Necromancers fill the valley from Orgrul south-west to Nerlokh's post at its western mouth; players have met them all along it. Nerlokh is a Gelkis scout. Corpsefeeders, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack anyone.
  collect 254663 quest 92844.1        -- Gently Cursed Bones: Undead Ravagers
  kill 11559 x6 quest 92846.1

step Magram: Corrupting Tears
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: Orgrul wants three Petrified Bark from the valley's accursed trees (the game's data has no spot for them) and three Imbued Tears: Warug keeps the crystals you took from the Gelkis, so ask him.
  turnin 92844                        -- Orgrul: 500
  turnin 92846                        -- Orgrul: 500
  accept 92847
  collect 254841 quest 92847.1        -- Petrified Bark: the valley's accursed trees
  collect 254840 quest 92847.2 npc 5398 -- Imbued Tears: Warug

step Magram: Proof of Concept
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: Orgrul gives you a Rudimentary Necromancy Staff. He laid out two skeletons on the hill just east of his post: put the staff to use there, and the Nascent Undead Ravagers give the Well Cursed Bones.
  turnin 92847                        -- Orgrul: 500
  accept 92873
  collect 254842 quest 92873.1        -- Well Cursed Bones: Nascent Undead Ravagers

step Magram: Orgrul's next tasks
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: Orgrul pays 500 and your pick of three items for level 35: Blade of the Magram Clan (one-handed sword), Staff of Revelations (staff) or Desperate Barrier (shield).
  turnin 92873 choose 271796 271797 271798 -- Orgrul: 500
  accept 92893
  accept 92894

step Magram: the heart of the valley
  zone Shen'dralas
  tip From the quest data: south-east of Orgrul, in the heart of the valley, the Magram keep Gelkis Captives: kill five. The Haggard Bones there are failed summons stuck in the ground: raise ten with the Enhanced Necromancy Staff Orgrul gave you, and kill the ones that fight back. Corpsefeeders, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack anyone; the Magram Necrokhans, elite too, leave a friend of the Magram alone.
  kill 253431 x5 quest 92893.1
  kill 253446 x10 quest 92894.1 "Raise or slay Haggard Bones"

step Magram: Bristleback Retreat
  tip From the quest data: back to Orgrul, then east to Bristleback Retreat for his next order.
  turnin 92893                        -- Orgrul: 500
  turnin 92894                        -- Orgrul: 500
  accept 93066

step Magram: the quilboar
  tip From the quest data: the Bristleback quilboar hold Bristleback Retreat, east of the valley. Kog'thug the Brave (elite, level 43) and Quolga the Wise (elite, level 42) lead them: leave those two be. Then report to Hagiak at the Magram Front, south of the Retreat.
  kill 253524 x4 quest 93066.1
  kill 253525 x6 quest 93066.2
  kill 253526 x6 quest 93066.3

step Magram: Hagiak at the Magram Front
  tip From the quest data: Hagiak sends you south-west to the Outcast Hideaway, the exiles' camp west of the Shen'dralar town.
  turnin 93066                        -- Hagiak: 500
  accept 93072
  accept 93129

step Magram: the Outcast Hideaway
  tip From the quest data: Outcast Scouts and Marauders hold the hideaway, with Outcast Necrokhans, elite and level 45, among them. The Stolen Supplies are crates in its west. The quest wants Outcast Necromancers here too; players have met them only in the valley between Orgrul and Nerlokh so far, so take them there if the hideaway has none.
  kill 254283 x2 quest 93072.1
