step Magram: Khan Jehn
  zone Desolace
  tip From the quest data: take the Ultimate Necromancy Staff to the ritual site, a tent by the lake in the middle of Magram Village, and raise Khan Jehn. The risen khan takes the quest: 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: Scavenged Magram Armament (polearm: Stamina, attack power, Agility), Greatstaff of the Necrokhans (staff: Intellect, Stamina, Spirit) or Soulsplatter Mace (main-hand mace: Intellect, Stamina, Spirit). The quest costs the Gelkis 30,000.
  complete 93196                      -- raise Khan Jehn at the tent by the lake
