step The totem recipes
  label recipes
  tip Both quartermasters sell the same 12 recipes for Carved Centaur Totems, no standing needed: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Agility and - Lesser Healing Power; Greater Spellblasting and Greater Frenzy Potion; Hard Gold Gauntlet and Iron Morningstar plans; Mystic Thick Armor Kit, Silk Reagent Bag, Stormcloth Gloves and Centaur Hoofwarmers patterns; the Centaur Banner Deployment Device and Hoof-Shaped Foot Pedal schematics. Keep the totems you need for them before you hand the rest in.
  talk 253139 optional                -- Gorhak, Magram Village
  talk 253140 @35.6,92.0 optional     -- Molkar, Gelkis Village
